{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Backrooms: Noise</strong></i> is a cooperative horror game for 1-4 players. Explore a dimension where even silence doesn't sound right. The world doesn't explain itself - and the more you try to understand it, the further you feel from the answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 to 4 player co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proximity voice chat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive AI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game Difficulties </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large &amp; difficult map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Primitive but challenging gameplay </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn\u2019t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the <strong>SNK V2 system</strong> \u2014 featuring an improved main menu, enhanced lobby, online server browser, difficulty selection, player sound system (with UI feedback and AI reaction), and a dynamic visibility system based on movement, posture, and flashlight use.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799280?t=1758312309","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799280/daf9673e891f5b218958d8d72d4d18f9fca9a041/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758312309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799280/68533a996b097bd07766d272643ca05fbf0c7a30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758312309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799280/68533a996b097bd07766d272643ca05fbf0c7a30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758312309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Backrooms: Noise</strong></i> is a cooperative horror game for 1-4 players. Explore a dimension where even silence doesn't sound right. The world doesn't explain itself - and the more you try to understand it, the further you feel from the answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 to 4 player co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proximity voice chat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive AI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game Difficulties </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large &amp; difficult map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Primitive but challenging gameplay </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn\u2019t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the <strong>SNK V2 system</strong> \u2014 featuring an improved main menu, enhanced lobby, online server browser, difficulty selection, player sound system (with UI feedback and AI reaction), and a dynamic visibility system based on movement, posture, and flashlight use.</p>","developers":["Skmaestro"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799280/2934f0a4054428dfb4889d82fbd6eb7f14ff2e82/header.jpg?t=1758312309","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3799280/289925295/bb2e9c10bf073396b1954ede18f4dcb8e97310da/1758024064/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758025346","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3799280/289925295/bb2e9c10bf073396b1954ede18f4dcb8e97310da/1758024064/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758025346","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3799280/289925295/bb2e9c10bf073396b1954ede18f4dcb8e97310da/1758024064/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758025346","id":257198701,"name":"2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257198701/360d1c13ce540c1c388712c8cc5dde7f5d2ea688/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758025346"}],"name":"Backrooms: Noise","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Backrooms: Noise - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$1.99</span> $1.11 USD","packageid":1336317,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-44% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":111}],"title":"Buy Backrooms: Noise"}],"packages":[1336317],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</st